  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fast Track Initiative Grant III for Basic Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve the objectives of the PDDEB to raise the educational level and diversify the skills of the labor force to help promote equitable economic growth, the proposed PEBSG-3 operation will support Government reforms and further strengthen its education sector institutions to: (i) Increase access and equity to basic education (ii) Improve the quality, efficiency, and relevance of basic education, and (iii) Strengthen sector management  and monitoring and evaluation of the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
